      "content": "Antoni Norbert Patek (French: \"Antoine Norbert de Patek\" ; 14 June 1812 – 1 March 1877), was a Polish pioneer in watchmaking and a creator of Patek Philippe & Co., one of the most famous watchmaker companies.",
